{"id":"c417c668c09a97ed","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-corepi.md","title":"Essential prime implicants (legacy CorePI notation)","display":"df-corepi — Essential prime implicants (legacy CorePI notation)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-corepi","aliases":["27-df-corepi"],"display":"df-corepi — Essential prime implicants (legacy CorePI notation)","depends_on":["[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§3.3.2 Definition 3.3","source_printed_pages":"146","source_pdf_pages":"170","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-equivalence-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-corepi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-corepi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-corepi — Essential prime implicants (legacy CorePI notation)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.2 Definition 3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"146"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"170"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-equivalence-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>，真点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(f)\">\\(T(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\coloneqq\\{P\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\mid\\exists a\\in T(f)\\;(P(a)=1\\land\\forall Q\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\setminus\\{P\\}\\;(Q(a)=0))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\coloneqq\\{P\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\mid\\exists a\\in T(f)\\;(P(a)=1\\land\\forall Q\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\setminus\\{P\\}\\;(Q(a)=0))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留历史 CorePI 符号，但此概念在书中叫 essential prime implicant，不是额外的 core 类。具有独占真点显然强制 P 出现在每个 prime DNF；若没有独占真点，删除 P 后其他全部 prime 仍覆盖 f，故 P 不 essential。此论证建立与 Definition 3.3 的精确对应。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]，真点集 $T(f)$ 见 [[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]，真点集 $T(f)$ 见 [[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"T(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\coloneqq\\{P\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\mid\\exists a\\in T(f)\\;(P(a)=1\\land\\forall Q\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\setminus\\{P\\}\\;(Q(a)=0))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1366,"backlinks":[{"id":"c4267d89593cf1f4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)$ (core prime implicants, see [[27-df-corepi]])"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-corepi|df-corepi — Essential prime implicants (legacy CorePI notation)]]"},{"id":"95e854a713c07e6d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)$ (essential prime implicants, see [[27-df-corepi]])"},{"id":"50123b27e10d65fc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$、$\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-corepi]]，$\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-mindnf]]。"}],"outgoing":["3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","98e5c19fe4a2b9e2"]}